    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, .....<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;......<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>odd</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>even</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://w